Main modifications made in WorkWindowsBar (see HANDOFF.md for details):
- Product renamed to WorkWindowsBar (executable, window titles, texts,
  settings folder %LOCALAPPDATA%\WorkWindowsBar, autostart entry, mutex).
  Settings are migrated once from %LOCALAPPDATA%\RetroBar.
- Task buttons: fixed-height rows that fill the taskbar height
  (TaskRowHeight / MaxTaskRows), configurable width, optional multi-line titles.
- Quick Launch: resizable width with icons laid out in rows; context menu
  "Open Quick Launch folder"; default folder changed to the classic
  Quick Launch folder.
- Notification area: resizable width; icons spread evenly over the area.
- New theme "Moderno Oscuro" (flat, dark), set as default.
- Selectable start button icon (theme default, bundled "Cerdito", or user images).
- Task buttons stay highlighted after an app requests attention until activated.
- Upstream update checks disabled; upstream installer/CI replaced.
